1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,280
We were never taught how to be angry,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,660
we were only taught how to hide it.

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,240
In most Indian homes,

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,020
anger had only one meaning which

5
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,020
is disrespect.

6
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:10,550
So raise your voice,

7
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,070
you're rude.

8
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:11,810
Push back,

9
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:12,670
you're difficult.

10
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:14,430
Say this hurt me to an elder,

11
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,130
completely out of the question.

12
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,310
So you learn very early to swallow

13
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,270
your anger and convince yourself

14
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:21,580
it wasn't a big deal.

15
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,940
You got so good at it that you started

16
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,180
calling it maturity.

17
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,460
But here's what the research actually shows.

18
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,600
Anger that does not have anywhere

19
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,340
to go does not disappear,

20
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,580
it converts.

21
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,520
Studies have found direct links

22
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,280
between chronic anger suppression

23
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,480
and conditions like IBS,

24
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,460
chronic headaches,

25
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,620
high blood pressure and lot of autoimmune

26
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,440
disorders.

27
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,880
So your body starts expressing what

28
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,020
your mouth was never allowed to say.

29
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:48,510
Researchers in India specifically

30
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:50,370
found that emotional suppression

31
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:52,510
is one of the strongest predictors

32
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:54,630
of anxiety and depression in a lot

33
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:55,650
of young adults.

34
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,710
So the anger is not the problem.

35
00:00:57,730 --> 00:00:59,170
Anger is information.

36
00:00:59,290 --> 00:01:01,050
It tells you when a boundary has

37
00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:01,790
been crossed,

38
00:01:01,990 --> 00:01:03,910
when something matters to you deeply,

39
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:05,590
when you have been treated in a

40
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:07,350
way that does not sit right.

41
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,860
Feeling it does not make you a bad person.

42
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,420
It makes you honest.

43
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,300
Goal was never to stop feeling angry,

44
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,340
but goal is to feel it,

45
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:18,500
name it and express it honestly.
